xml:base="https://bestrunningpodcasts.com/between-two-pines.html"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name>Hans Kristian Smedsrød Engdahl</name><email>hans@naerdetalvor.no</email></author><category term="podcast" /><category term="trail" /><category term="ultra" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[A running podcast for people who think running podcasts are stupid. Dom Grossman and Andy Pearson ask their guests hilariously insulting questions in a "between two ferns" style manner.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">The Way Of The Runner</title><link href="https://bestrunningpodcasts.com/the-way-of-the-runner.html" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="The Way Of The Runner" /><published>2026-05-29T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-05-29T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://bestrunningpodcasts.com/the-way-of-the-runner</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://bestrunningpodcasts.com/the-way-of-the-runner.html"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name>Hans Kristian Smedsrød Engdahl</name><email>hans@naerdetalvor.no</email></author><category term="podcast" /><category term="ultra" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Award-winning author Adharanand Finn talks to runners of every kind about the joy and experience of running.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Trail Runner Nation</title><link href="https://bestrunningpodcasts.com/trail-runner-nation.html" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Trail Runner Nation" /><published>2026-05-29T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-05-29T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://bestrunningpodcasts.com/trail-runner-nation</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://bestrunningpodcasts.com/trail-runner-nation.html"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name>Hans Kristian Smedsrød Engdahl</name><email>hans@naerdetalvor.no</email></author><category term="podcast" /><category term="trail" /><category term="ultra" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Trail Runner Nation is devoted to sharing knowledge and advice to the trail running community - from beginners to the pros! Tips and discussions regarding race nutrition, pacing strategy, mental focus and much more from well-respected members of the trail community.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">The Real Science Of Sport</title><link href="https://bestrunningpodcasts.com/the-real-science-of-sports.html" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="The Real Science Of Sport" /><published>2026-05-29T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-05-29T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://bestrunningpodcasts.com/the-real-science-of-sports</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://bestrunningpodcasts.com/the-real-science-of-sports.html"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name>Hans Kristian Smedsrød Engdahl</name><email>hans@naerdetalvor.no</email></author><category term="podcast" /><category term="track" /><category term="science" /><category term="road" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[World-renowned sports scientist Professor Ross Tucker and veteran sports journalist Mike Finch break down the myths, practices and controversies from the world of sport. They cover all sports, and 75% of the episodes have some running related content.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">The Midpacker Podcast</title><link href="https://bestrunningpodcasts.com/the-midpacker-podcast.html" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="The Midpacker Podcast" /><published>2026-05-29T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-05-29T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://bestrunningpodcasts.com/the-midpacker-podcast</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://bestrunningpodcasts.com/the-midpacker-podcast.html"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name>Hans Kristian Smedsrød Engdahl</name><email>hans@naerdetalvor.no</email></author><category term="podcast" /><category term="trail" /><category term="ultra" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Troy Meadows presents a podcast which follows middle and back of the pack trail runners and ultra runners at the heart of the trail running community.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Choose Strong</title><link href="https://bestrunningpodcasts.com/choose-strong.html" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Choose Strong" /><published>2026-05-29T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-05-29T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://bestrunningpodcasts.com/choose-strong</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://bestrunningpodcasts.com/choose-strong.html"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name>Hans Kristian Smedsrød Engdahl</name><email>hans@naerdetalvor.no</email></author><category term="podcast" /><category term="trail" /><category term="ultra" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[The host, Sally McRae, is a pro athlete , wife, mother, and biz owner. She seeks to encourage others to live a strong and courageous life and covers a variety of life focused topics including running, total wellness, mindset, parenting, life balance, the impact of social media, and staying motivated while working toward goals.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Women of Distance</title><link href="https://bestrunningpodcasts.com/women-of-distance.html" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Women of Distance" /><published>2026-05-29T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-05-29T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://bestrunningpodcasts.com/women-of-distance</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://bestrunningpodcasts.com/women-of-distance.html"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name>Hans Kristian Smedsrød Engdahl</name><email>hans@naerdetalvor.no</email></author><category term="podcast" /><category term="trail" /><category term="ultra" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[A podcast about the women of Mountain, Trail, Ultra and Road running worlds. Hosted by Devon Yanko.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Uphill Athlete</title><link href="https://bestrunningpodcasts.com/uphill-athlete.html" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Uphill Athlete" /><published>2026-05-29T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-05-29T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://bestrunningpodcasts.com/uphill-athlete</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://bestrunningpodcasts.com/uphill-athlete.html"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name>Hans Kristian Smedsrød Engdahl</name><email>hans@naerdetalvor.no</email></author><category term="podcast" /><category term="trail" /><category term="ultra" /><category term="skyrunning" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Legendary alpine climber Steve House brings you highly informative discussions that range widely across topics, including running.]]></summary></entry></feed>